00:49:14.000 --> 00:49:34.000
dream bigger. So in the Congo, he's a monopolist, but he wants to expand that monopoly into other fields. Yes. Now there are the first glimmers of criticism. The very first critic really is an African American missionary called George Washington Williams. He went to the Congo to try to save souls. Well, he's an amazing man, isn't he?

